2. What are your daily responsibilities in your current project?
Answer:
 "My daily responsibilities include monitoring the application and infrastructure, checking CI/CD pipelines, troubleshooting deployment issues, managing Docker containers, checking Kubernetes workloads, and working with Git. I also monitor logs and system performance and automate repetitive tasks whenever possible."

> Hindi me Question ka matlab:
"Tum apne project me daily kya-kya kaam karte ho?"
Interviewer ye check kar raha hai ki tumhe real DevOps daily workflow ka idea hai ya sirf tools ke naam yaad hain.
> Yaad rakho:
Monitor → Deploy → Troubleshoot → Automate

Explain the technologies you used in your current project.
Answer:
 "In my project, I use Git and GitHub for source code management, Jenkins for CI/CD automation, Docker for containerization, Kubernetes for deploying and managing containers, Terraform for infrastructure provisioning, and AWS for cloud infrastructure. I also use monitoring and logging tools to check application health and performance."

> Hindi me Question ka matlab:
"Tumhare project me kaun-kaun si technologies use hui hain aur unka kya kaam hai?"
Interviewer ye dekhna chahta hai ki tum tool ka naam hi nahi, uska purpose bhi jaante ho.

> Simple mapping:
Git → Code
Jenkins → CI/CD
Docker → Container
Kubernetes → Container Management
Terraform → Infrastructure
AWS → Cloud
Monitoring → Health Check

